  {
   "id": "paper-cut-mansion-86512@1.3",
   "gameId": "paper-cut-mansion-86512",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-02T13:00:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Heya friends!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have addressed a bunch of the issues that you reported in the Paper Cut Mansion Steam Community. Thank you so much for sharing your feedback there, we really appreciate that. Please continue to provide us with alle the feedback you have, so that we can make the game the best experience possible. ❤️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "This is the change log of update 1.3",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improved performance (especially floor 6)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game will now start on the main menu, giving the chance to new players to access the settings (for example to change the language or the resolution) before the intro",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The intro can be skipped after has been completed once",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The howl in the intro should now track the player correctly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players can no longer accidentally get locked in the VIP room if leaving the game there",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grace period for traps after you change dimension",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Occasionally some levels were having issues generating the navigation mesh, resulting in a very low frame rate and enemies unable to move. The problem is solved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's it for now, friends. Of course, we will keep you informed about all upcoming Paper Cut Mansion updates here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spooky greetings out of the Mansion - see you inside!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gabriele & The Paper Cut Mansion Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
